# Local-only Playwright overrides. Some environments ship a Chromium build that
# does not match the version @playwright/test expects, and the workaround is an
# executablePath pointing at whatever is actually installed — a path that is
# meaningless anywhere else and breaks CI if committed. Keep those in a
# playwright.local-*.config.ts and run with --config, rather than editing
# playwright.config.ts and hoping to remember to revert it.
app/playwright.local-*.config.ts
